    "description": {
      "value": "Made of cobalt-colored steel rings that flow down the entire length of the garment, this +1 resilient chain mail includes an armored face covering. The armor is said to be based on the same armor once worn by Azure Leopard, one of Old-Mage Jatembe's magic warriors.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Frequency once per day\nYou call upon the ferocity and grace of the leopard. The armor's rings flatten out to become a solid piece of flexible armor. You gain a +2 item bonus to Stealth checks and Intimidation checks to Demoralize, but take a \u20132 penalty to Diplomacy and Society checks.\n\nThis lasts for 1 hour, but you can Activate the armor again to revert it back to its original form."
